WEBVTT

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.239
Konnichi-what?

00:00:13.284 --> 00:00:14.503
[weapons powering up]

00:00:14.677 --> 00:00:16.418
[motorbike revving]

00:00:25.035 --> 00:00:26.689
[tires squeal]

00:00:32.173 --> 00:00:36.264
I'm sorry, we already had
our big motorcycle chase
for the evening.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:41.878
Commander Walters!

00:00:42.052 --> 00:00:43.314
[Knuckles grunts]

00:00:43.488 --> 00:00:45.534
[Sonic] Commander Walters,
are you okay?

00:00:46.709 --> 00:00:47.710
Sonic...

00:00:47.884 --> 00:00:49.146
[painful grunt]

00:00:50.321 --> 00:00:51.453
...take this.

00:00:51.627 --> 00:00:53.672
[Sonic] What is it?[Walters] A key...

00:00:54.891 --> 00:00:57.459
to the most powerful weapon
GUN has ever built.

00:00:57.633 --> 00:01:00.157
You're the only one I trust
to keep it safe.

00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:02.028
[exhales weakly]

00:01:02.203 --> 00:01:03.508
Commander Walters...

00:01:03.682 --> 00:01:05.206
[sirens, vehicles approaching][gasps]

00:01:09.514 --> 00:01:11.168
[indistinct shouts]

00:01:12.343 --> 00:01:13.823
Alpha team, fan out!

00:01:15.216 --> 00:01:16.608
Do we have eyes?

00:01:17.261 --> 00:01:18.262
Secure the perimeter!

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:22.919
Medevac is en route.

00:01:23.093 --> 00:01:24.747
[indistinct radio chatter]

00:01:26.749 --> 00:01:28.229
His launch key is missing.

00:01:35.453 --> 00:01:37.673
I knew they couldn't be trusted.

00:01:39.936 --> 00:01:41.546
[all exclaiming]

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.156
[Tails] Why are we
running from GUN?

00:01:43.331 --> 00:01:44.810
Aren't we on the same team?

00:01:44.984 --> 00:01:46.247
[Sonic] Until we get
more information,

00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:48.118
we're not trusting anyone.

00:01:48.292 --> 00:01:49.989
- Follow me.
- Get it... off!

00:02:07.703 --> 00:02:09.705
Hold it right there,
Tokyo Drift!

00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:11.272
Who are you?

00:02:14.144 --> 00:02:16.494
[gasps] It's the Goat Milker!

00:02:16.668 --> 00:02:18.931
[mimicking Knuckles]
"It's the Goat Milker!"

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.151
Relax.
I'm not here to fight.

00:02:21.325 --> 00:02:24.372
- Then why are you here?
- And why did you free Shadow?

00:02:24.546 --> 00:02:26.461
Are you kidding?

00:02:26.635 --> 00:02:30.247
The last thing we want
is more super-powered
hedgehogs running around.

00:02:30.421 --> 00:02:32.380
The doctor had nothing
to do with it.

00:02:34.077 --> 00:02:35.905
And I can prove it.[car alarm chirps]

00:02:51.312 --> 00:02:52.922
Please,

00:02:53.096 --> 00:02:54.140
join me in the crab.

00:02:55.707 --> 00:02:58.884
[narrator] <i>And now back to...
"La UÚltima Pasión."</i>

00:02:59.058 --> 00:03:00.756
I have fallen in love
with another.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.714
[gasps]

00:03:02.888 --> 00:03:06.152
But who, Gabriella?
Tell me who!

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:10.113
My twin brother, Pablo?

00:03:11.332 --> 00:03:12.768
<i>Pablo!</i>

00:03:14.683 --> 00:03:16.075
!¡Bastardo!

00:03:16.249 --> 00:03:18.643
Buenos días, !¡hermano!

00:03:18.817 --> 00:03:19.949
<i>No!</i>

00:03:20.123 --> 00:03:22.255
[cackling]

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.736
Let that be a lesson
to you, Juan.

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.477
[beeping]
Family

00:03:26.651 --> 00:03:29.872
is a field
of emotional claymores

00:03:30.046 --> 00:03:32.265
that leave you abandoned,
betrayed

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:36.922
and weeping
while you eat cake,

00:03:37.096 --> 00:03:39.490
which creates copious amounts
of adipose tissue,

00:03:39.664 --> 00:03:42.667
and what some calloused
individuals refer to as...

00:03:42.841 --> 00:03:45.453
[sniffs deeply]
...man boobs.

00:03:45.627 --> 00:03:46.802
Ha.

00:03:48.717 --> 00:03:50.980
[up-tempo Latin jazz playing]

00:03:56.159 --> 00:03:57.769
[slapping along
with the congas]

00:04:00.337 --> 00:04:01.904
[trilling loudly]

00:04:03.035 --> 00:04:04.428
[shrieking]

00:04:04.602 --> 00:04:06.648
Doctor,
we have visitors.

00:04:08.127 --> 00:04:10.129
Really?

00:04:10.303 --> 00:04:13.002
I thought I was having
an anthropomorphic nightmare.

00:04:13.176 --> 00:04:14.656
Where the only person
I could trust in the world

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.353
showed up with
all my worst enemies,

00:04:16.527 --> 00:04:18.224
while I was in a bathrobe,

00:04:18.399 --> 00:04:20.662
playing congas
on my big, fat belly!

00:04:20.836 --> 00:04:22.098
Sorry, sir.

00:04:22.272 --> 00:04:24.405
I don't believe it.
Eggman's alive?

00:04:24.579 --> 00:04:26.929
And he's never
looked worse.

00:04:27.103 --> 00:04:29.410
[cackling] Well, maybe,

00:04:29.584 --> 00:04:33.457
this is what not giving a damn
what you think
I look like looks like.

00:04:33.631 --> 00:04:36.852
Sir, right now we have
an even bigger problem.

00:04:37.026 --> 00:04:38.419
Oh, come on.

00:04:40.551 --> 00:04:42.858
There's an imposter out there
using your technology.

00:04:43.032 --> 00:04:46.339
Imposter.
That's impossi-- What?

00:04:46.514 --> 00:04:47.993
No.

00:04:48.167 --> 00:04:52.215
My sweet mechanized spawn!

00:04:52.389 --> 00:04:56.001
Whomever this party-pooping
posse is looking for

00:04:56.175 --> 00:04:58.482
has stolen my persona

00:04:58.656 --> 00:05:02.007
and the precious babies
from my egg sac.

00:05:02.704 --> 00:05:04.183
Well...

00:05:04.357 --> 00:05:08.753
I'll soon egg-xact
my revenge.

00:05:08.927 --> 00:05:10.581
You see what I did there?[chuckles]

00:05:10.755 --> 00:05:13.976
It's time for the dramatic
soap-opera twist,

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:18.284
where this Pablo
reveals his Juan!

00:05:18.459 --> 00:05:22.332
By cross-referencing
the precise coordinates

00:05:22.506 --> 00:05:25.248
of each drone's
energy spikes,

00:05:25.988 --> 00:05:28.120
I can track my babies

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:30.906
to the imposter's
base of operations,

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.473
right about...

00:05:32.647 --> 00:05:33.474
there!

00:05:33.648 --> 00:05:35.388
Sonic, I hate to say it,

00:05:35.563 --> 00:05:37.739
but I think we're both
after the same person.

00:05:37.913 --> 00:05:40.350
Hold on, hold on.
You're not suggesting
we team up

00:05:40.524 --> 00:05:42.831
with Doctor Ro-Butt-Stink,
are you?

00:05:43.005 --> 00:05:44.441
Perhaps the fox is right.

00:05:44.615 --> 00:05:47.488
It could be our only chance
to find this mysterious,

00:05:47.662 --> 00:05:49.054
more impressive hedgehog.

00:05:49.228 --> 00:05:50.403
[groans]

00:05:50.578 --> 00:05:52.623
All right, Egghead.
I hate to say it,

00:05:52.797 --> 00:05:54.364
but it looks like
we're partners.

00:05:55.496 --> 00:05:57.410
On one condition.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:01.458
Dude, you have serious issues.

00:06:01.632 --> 00:06:02.720
Ow!

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:06.376
[gibbering spasm]

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:07.725
Let's...

00:06:08.509 --> 00:06:09.640
do this!

00:06:09.814 --> 00:06:11.512
["Firestarter"
by The Prodigy playing]

00:06:18.257 --> 00:06:19.389
[pained groan]

00:06:32.924 --> 00:06:34.839
[door thuds][Robotnik grunting]

00:06:36.014 --> 00:06:37.233
Suck it in!

00:06:37.407 --> 00:06:38.582
[grunting][door rattling]

00:06:39.757 --> 00:06:41.106
Tinker-tailor?

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:42.717
I need room.

00:06:42.891 --> 00:06:45.546
Think Elvis, circa 1976.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.983
But sir, I don't have
the proper materials.

00:06:49.027 --> 00:06:50.376
Found some.

00:06:52.901 --> 00:06:54.076
Resourceful.

00:06:56.513 --> 00:06:58.428
[thunder rumbling]

